# rows-arrows (H4): the pointer on a's left chevron (291, 450 at b8a0e1d;
# was 291, 432 at 5714319, and the header's 291, 299 predates h4-readout's
# card move) and clicked — the chevrons are decorative (no handler at this
# hash either: the press reaches the scrub box), so at b8a0e1d the click
# opens the field with its text selected and the typing tip under the box;
# the URL keeps nothing.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 291 450
wait 150
click 291 450
wait 200
shot rows-arrows
